  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Carissa bispinosa",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carissa_bispinosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1362131397,
      "text": "Carissa bispinosa grows as a shrub or small tree up to 5 metres (16 ft) tall. Its fragrant flowers feature a white corolla. The fruit is red when ripe. Its habitat is woodland and forest from 1,080 m (3,540 ft) to 1,630 m (5,350 ft) elevation. Vernacular names for the plant include forest num-num and Y-thorned carissa. Carissa bispinosa is native to an area from Uganda to South Africa."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Carissa bispinosa",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carissa_bispinosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 231356086,
      "text": "Carissa bispinosa est une espèce de la famille des Apocynaceae. Ses noms vernaculaires sont num-num forestier et carissa à épines Y."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Carissa bispinosa",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carissa_bispinosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 28811249,
      "text": "Carissa bispinosa tumbuh sebagai semak atau pohon kecil hingga setinggi 5 meter (16 ft). Bunganya yang harum memiliki mahkota berwarna putih. Buahnya berwarna merah saat matang. Habitatnya adalah hutan dan rimba dari 1.080 m (3.540 ft) hingga 1.630 m (5.350 ft)ketinggian. Nama vernakular untuk tanaman ini termasuk forest num-num dan Y-thorned carissa. Carissa bispinosa merupakan tanaman asli dari Uganda hingga Afrika Selatan."
    }
